00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.550
In any case...

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:34.060
Rio, you never knew your father and were raised by your mother, a dealer.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.230
After your mother's mysterious disappearance...

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:39.330
