00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.120
Yes.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.870
On the other hand, Rina's mother has been hospitalized for a long time.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:47.700
Her father is always out working, and she spent her childhood alone.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:54.690
Your grandfather entrusted Rio's mother with you, and you were raised as sisters...

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:59.090
