00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:34.820
Me, too.

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:36.750
Some drinks for the customers.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:37.540
Yes.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.540
Yes.

